          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.10.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.10.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 10:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Behold, the Lord, Jehovah of hosts, will lop the boughs with terror: and the high of stature shall be hewn down, and the lofty shall be brought low. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.10.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.10.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 10:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And he will cut down the thickets of the forest with iron, and Lebanon shall fall by a mighty one.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.10.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.10.34"
            ]
          }
